                        </li>
                                                <li class="">
                            <a href="?page=our-team&lang=en">
                                Our Team                            </a>
                        </li>
                                                <li class="">
                            <a href="?page=about&lang=en">
                                About Us                            </a>
                        </li>
                                                <li class="">
                            <a href="?page=contact&lang=en">
                                Contact Us                            </a>
                        </li>
                                            </ul>
                </nav>
                
                <!-- Section 3: Language Switcher -->
                <div class="language-switcher">
                                        <a href="?page=team-member&id=itai-ruschkewitz&lang=en" class="lang-switch active" data-lang="en">EN</a>
                    <span class="separator">|</span>
                    <a href="?page=team-member&id=itai-ruschkewitz&lang=he" class="lang-switch " data-lang="he">עב</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>
    <main id="main-content">



<section class="team-member-page">
    <div class="member-container">
                    <a href="?page=team-member&id=dan-rosenberg&lang=en" class="member-navigation-button prev-button" title="Previous Member">
                <span class="arrow-icon">»</span>
            </a>
                
        <div class="member-profile professional-card">
            <div class="member-image-container">
                                    <img src="assets/images/team/itai_ruschkewitz.png" alt="Itay Ruschkewitz" class="member-image">
                            </div>
            
            <div class="member-info">
                <h1>Itay Ruschkewitz</h1>
                <p class="member-title">CEO and Co-Founder</p>
                <div class="member-bio">
                    Owner and CEO of Complex, a financial consulting firm, where he serves as an advisor to a wide range of leading entities in the Israeli economy, including banks, insurance companies, and financial institutions. Has extensive experience in formulating strategies and financing plans, developing new financial instruments in the Israeli capital market, raising financing, leading transactions, and issuing complex instruments, including securitizations, private debt, and complex bonds such as CoCo. Represents Allianz Global Investors, the investment arm of Allianz, in Israel. Previously served as a partner at PwC Israel and before that as a partner at Giza Singer Even.                </div>
                
                            </div>
        </div>
        
                    <a href="?page=team-member&id=buky-katzman&lang=en" class="member-navigation-button next-button" title="Next Member">
                <span class="arrow-icon">»</span>
            </a>
            </div>
</section>

</main>
